(Fun fact: Amanda is the Carnegie‚Äôs head of exhibitions, and her brother is Stanford paleobotanist Andrew Leslie. He was an undergrad at Penn when I was a grad student, in the same tiny department. I swear I didn‚Äôt know this before I met her. What are the chances?!)

